# Built dashboard JS bundle + source maps. Editable source is in
# app/src/main/dashboard-src/js/; dashboard-tests/build.mjs (esbuild) compiles it
# into this dir, which Gradle's buildDashboardJs runs as part of preBuild.
app/src/main/assets/dashboard/js/
# Dependency-lock files. settings-gradle.lockfile stays ignored, but
# app/gradle.lockfile is committed (un-ignored below) so the OSV scan and the
# release build resolve the shipped releaseRuntimeClasspath against a reproducible,
# version-pinned lock (see app/build.gradle — only that classpath is locked).
*.lockfile
!app/gradle.lockfile
